#N canvas 100 100 1450 1250 12;
#X text 20 15 Original player transport during fades. Arg: player ID. Track 1 only.;
#X text 20 40 PLAYER-test-transport symbol OUTPUT.wav. Requires bounded-player-capture.;
#X text 20 65 Stop/play/pause/resume/reverse and cancelled slice. Playback stops 7s / capture 8s.;
